# A clip the user picked through the platform's own picker plays
# (docs/media-plan.md §2, the maintainer's ruling of 2026-09-30): the picked
# file reaches the player as the platform names it, a path on the desktops, a
# content:// URI on Android and the picker's URL on iOS, where a phone used to
# leave the player idle without a word. Two clips, the decoy sorting first,
# since a dialog completes with the only row when nothing is selected
# (docs/traps.md).
expect label#0 "idle"
copy_asset media/hevc_aac.mp4 $TMP/kaya-clips-$PID/decoy.mp4
copy_asset media/h264_aac.mp4 $TMP/kaya-clips-$PID/picked.mp4
file_dialog_goto $TMP/kaya-clips-$PID
click button#0
expect_file_dialog kaya-clips-$PID decoy.mp4 picked.mp4
file_choose picked.mp4
expect label#1 "picked.mp4"
expect_video_ink video#0 "C83C1E"
expect label#0 "ready 2.0s 160x90, played past 1s, ended, can_play yes"
